{"id":"nb64585516d","headline":"July Consumer Price Inflation at 2.8%…Back Into the 2% Range After Three Months","summary":"South Korea's consumer prices rose 2.8% year on year in July, returning to the 2% range for the first time in three months. Lower petroleum price growth and government price support contributed.","why":"Consumer price inflation drives the Bank of Korea's interest-rate decisions, which affect Korean bond yields, the won and domestic equities.","category":"economy","event_type":"macro-data","importance":2,"flag":null,"market_moving":false,"location":{"place":"Seoul","country":"South Korea","lat":37.566,"lon":126.978,"region":"asia"},"entities":[],"links":[],"source":{"name":"한겨레","url":"https://www.hani.co.kr/arti/economy/economy_general/1271258.html"},"sources":[{"name":"한겨레","url":"https://www.hani.co.kr/arti/economy/economy_general/1271258.html"}],"published_at":"2026-08-03T23:00:00Z","retrieved_at":"2026-11-14T17:26:37Z","official":false,"ai_summary":true,"content_hash":"74fc337b10e82c81","impacts":[],"why_moved":null,"backfilled":true,"backfilled_at":"2026-11-14T17:26:37Z","backfill_provenance":{"version":"gdelt-backfill-v1","original_published_at":"2026-08-03T23:00:00Z","feed_url":"https://data.gdeltproject.org/gdeltv2/","discovered_via":"GDELT GKG 2.1","gdelt_seen":"2026-08-04T00:00:00Z","publisher_country_gdelt":"KS","description_from":"publisher page metadata, translated to English by Claude"},"headline_translated":true,"original_headline":"7월 소비자물가 상승률 2.8%…석달 만에 2%대로 내려와","source_language":"kor","image":{"kind":"topic","file":"photos/central-bank-building-4660039.jpg","alt":"central bank building (illustration)","credit":"DenisStreltsov","license":"Pixabay Content License","license_url":"https://pixabay.com/service/license-summary/","source":"Pixabay","source_url":"https://pixabay.com/photos/mumbai-india-the-central-bank-4660039/"}}